Lucky Star Chicken from "Hero of Fate" officially joins the world of Journey to the West.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44197405/d2253f3008a7bc0f6428e7c5ccceeaff39ff03de.gif[/img]

And this is just the beginning! With the interweaving and integration of the world of Journey to the West and "Hero of Fate", elements of the two worlds are gradually becoming linked.

What else happens next? What kind of changes will be caused by the fusion of the two worlds? Come to Journey to the West Survivor and
Find out in "Hero of Fate"...

I am very grateful to "Hero of Fate" for its strong support to the world of Journey to the West, and also very grateful to the adventurers of "Hero of Fate" for entering the world of Journey to the West to obtain the true scriptures.

Westlanders, if you want to experience a different popular game genre, you must not miss "Hero of Fate". The random fate gameplay in the game hides many unexpected special surprises inside the game.

update content:

1. Add a new hero Chicken Brother. Chicken Brother is not an optional hero. Chicken Essence Fragments will be randomly refreshed on the map. After talking to the Chicken Essence Fragments, you can replace the hero with Chicken Brother. Chicken Brother’s skill is [Chicken Party], which costs 250. An egg will hatch into a chick after 2.5 seconds. The chick will knock away nearby enemies;

2. Add the function of the earth temple store, which can use the inexhaustible ingots in the endless mode to extract attributes;

3. The endless mode gameplay has been revised. A portal will appear every 15 minutes, randomly teleporting to the next map. The time is reduced by 50 minutes and the difficulty is increased by 1 level;

4. Add mouse scrolling and zooming scenes;

5. Fixed the bug of repeated display of dodge probability;

1.0.3 version update

1. Added highlight tips for yellow treasures;
2. Adjusted the speed of the endless mode to 2.5 times (it is easy to die, please use it as appropriate);
3. Added M key to open the mini map;
4. Fixed the BUG of Drifting 2 skill malfunction;
5. Fixed the bug of not unlocking the 5th level of Chang'an in Farming and Demon;
6. Fixed the error in the description of the talent attributes of Bai Wuchang and Hei Wuchang;
7. Improved the lag problem caused by too many monsters and summons.

1. Shortened the shooting range of evil gods and farming long-range monsters;
2. Enhanced the difficulty of Endless Mode after 20 minutes;
3. Fixed Sand Monk Salted Fish not exploding;
4. Fixed the achievement of Little Dung Demon could not be completed;
5. Fixed Yang Jian’s talent cannot be activated (if the talent cannot be activated, you can reset the talent to fix it);
6. Fixed Dragon Girl’s unlimited talent cultivation.

Thanks for you love and support to us. If you have any problem or feedback about Journey to the West Survivors, please tell us in [url=https://discord.gg/UDTwcZdvap][b]DISCORD[/b][/url].

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44197405/16c946e8840c7b56cfa66acc0e18ea2c3b613e9e.png[/img]

1. Increased the pickup range of Farming and Demon;
2. Weakened the damage of the BOSS in Farming and Demon;
3. Adjusted the icons about Elemental Reaction;
4. Fixed the Murky would not disappear;
5. Fixed the Spouse UI would not appear after loading files;
6. Fixed the issue of incorrect unlocking of Farming and Demon levels;
7. Fixed the problem of control failure of the fate-changing handle;
8. Fixed the problem of some Summons pushing players to walk.

We deeply realized that there are still problems with the English translation. We will keep working on it and optimize it as soon as possible.

Thanks for your love and support to us. If you have any problem or feedback about Journey to the West Survivors, please tell us in [url=https://discord.gg/JsJmbxxF8C]DISCORD[/url].

0.838 BUG fixed

1. Fixed the small map Changan BUG;

2. Fixed the BUG of reaction display error;

3. Fixed the property settlement and display BUG of land temple;

0.837 Small map function test

1, added a small map function, can show the player's current position and the original location of the road, treasure chest; At present, the small map is only for testing, and the handle has not been adapted yet. It is expected to be updated next week.

2, fixed the banana fan resonance text display error and part of the BUG;

1, fixed the resonance repeated display error;

2. Fixed the display error of two Lu Zhishen lovers;

3, in the recall mode, the companion has increased its defense by 400 points, and it is less likely to die;

Version 0.835 updated

1. Improved the remaining resonance map;

2. Reduced the attack and health of enemies in the later stages of Endless mode;

3, the double repair can absorb the BOSS dropped treasure chest, including dropped outside the map, but can not absorb the initial treasure chest;

4. The property value of the land temple is improved, and the higher the cost of the yuan treasure, the more properties are obtained;

1, fixed entertainment mode can not unlock achievements and end bugs;


2. Add three resonances;

Guan Yu + Lu Bu = [Diao Chan], Diao Chan is a large range of AOE mage units;

White Emperor's Sword + Sword Lai/Sword domain = [Ten thousand swords return to Zong];

Marksmanship + banana fan = [gun out like a dragon];

At present, all martial arts, summoning, have been adapted to resonate;


3, added the element reaction display icon;

When you carry a spell that triggers an elemental reaction, the icon for that reaction will light up in the lower left corner of the screen;

1, cake monster reduced time BUG fix;

2. Added the function of land Temple store, which can purchase random properties by spending ingots;

3, the ground medicine and other fallen objects will disappear if not picked up for a long time;

4. Further reduce congestion

Version 0.832 updated


1, Cake monster reduced by 200 time, reduced by 230 minutes, the location of the four cake monsters is also changed to the core of the map that is easier for players to see (near the lovers or near the opening)


2, rewrite the brush algorithm to reduce the delay, if the endless mode is still delayed, please continue to feedback to me, we will continue to optimize until it is not stuck;

1. Fixed the BUG of North Club Luzhou Dao Lv;

2, the line of the new Taoist lover [Girl in White], in the North Ju Luzhou;

3, fixed the achievement, unlock condition description error, now unlock condition is to use your activated steam achievements to reverse push, even if the archive is lost as long as steam achievements will be unlocked, but if there is a situation where you unlock but steam does not have the corresponding achievement resulting in unlocking failure, we are deeply sorry, this update will not occur again;

4. Fixed Tiangong ingot and experience BUG;

5. The description of level unlocking conditions is online;





Today we will continue to address the novice boot related features. Previously configured steam cloud save, but may empty the previous save, now reimburses 2000 talent points.



If you are dissatisfied with the game and suggestions can be feedback to us, thank you very much for your understanding and support

