"West Journey Survivor" Early access version will be unlocked on August 23, 2023 Thank you for your continued support and expectations,


This Early access edition includes:


1, 12 players can choose characters;


2. 5 scene maps;


3, simple mode, ordinary mode, difficult mode, hell mode, hell mode, true fairy mode, endless mode;


4. 200 skills or resonances


5, farming mode experience version


More skills, characters, bosses, and monsters are constantly being updated.


However, it should be noted that this test version may contain more bugs and numerical imbalances, we will fix and improve these problems in a month, welcome to the group of supervisors!
